        | 33 | COMMRX[0] | 55 | Temp Capture | 77 | HDMI |
        | 34 | WatchDog | 56 | Reserved | 78 | SCD0 |
        | 35 | Timer0 | 57 | Reserved | 79 | SCD1 |
        | 36 | Timer1 | 58 | Reserved | 80 | PCIE_INTA |
        | 37 | Timer2 | 59 | TOE_INTR | 81 | PCIE_INTB |
